id: E553
draft: true
title: Bind Automake test identities to their configured result-file stems
trigger_tool: make|test
phase: testing
severity: 2
category: testing, autotools, build-system
match_keywords: Automake, TEST_EXTENSIONS, .test.trs, result-file stem, FileNotFoundError, full PASS summary
error_signature: FileNotFoundError.*[.]test[.]trs|No such file.*[.]test[.]trs
root_cause: Automake's configured test extensions can remove the test suffix when naming .log/.trs records. Appending .trs to the complete TESTS name is not a universal mapping; a real all-PASS suite can fail later evidence collection despite executing correctly.
affected_scope: Automake projects with shell or custom test extensions and a separate strict N/N evidence collector.
verification_cmd: Inventory original TESTS and configured TEST_EXTENSIONS, derive the generated result stem, and require one terminal PASS record per original identity with no duplicate or missing mapping; cross-check TOTAL/PASS/SKIP/FAIL in the actual suite summary.
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: configured-test-extension-result-mapping
rec_description: Preserve the original test identity and denominator, but resolve its result filename according to the generated Automake extension contract. Require the mapped file and one exact PASS terminal; never infer per-case PASS solely from an aggregate summary.
rec_command: For a confirmed .test extension mapping, read test_name.removesuffix('.test') + '.trs', while retaining the full original test_name as the inventory identity.
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: upstream-result-accounting
forbid_1_pattern: missing.*trs.*PASS|count.*summary.*instead.*records
forbid_1_reason: A result-file lookup bug must not be fixed by treating absent evidence as success or changing the test denominator.
forbid_1_consequence: Missing or unexecuted tests can be silently reported as passing.
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E553-draft-PL28.md
last_updated: 2026-10-15
source_event: libplist 2.8.0 native run printed TOTAL 43 PASS 43 but failed requesting empty.test.trs; generated records use empty.trs. A fresh corrected shared/static native Conan run verified every original identity and passed 43/43 plus 2/2 consumers per mode; log SHA256 1996d1cb59884369fd364210edb965afcd3dda29096bc681ea04ff600307f132.
authors: 2501_91199785; team 诶，云朵
